<title>USA: FGIC qualifies four muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies four muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co. said Wednesday it qualified for bond insurance the following four municipal issues:</p>
<p>--San Francisco, Calif., $48.05 million general obligations.</p>
<p>--Maui County, Hawaii, $17.75 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Bannock County SD, Idaho, $27.5 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Port Huron Area SD, Mich., $7.985 million school building and site bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
